<title>JAPAN: Exxon to delist from Tokyo stock exchange.</title>
<headline>Exxon to delist from Tokyo stock exchange.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exxon Corp of the United States said on Wednesday that it had decided to delist its shares from the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) due to low share turnover.</p>
</text>
